  "priorExpiration": "2019-08-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2309.01 Application Requirements. A food service establishment applying for a license as a food processing plant shall:\n\n(a) Comply with all of the application requirements described in He-P 2304.01;\n\n(b) Submit with the application a list of all food products to be produced in the food processing plant;\n\n(c) Submit a HACCP plan as part of the application as required by He-P 2304.13; and\n\n(d) Submit a copy of a finished product label.\n\nSource. #6722, eff 3-27-98; ss by #7893, eff 5-21-03; ss by #9857-A, eff 2-1-11; ss by #10867, eff 6-25-15; ss by #12729, INTERIM, eff 2-21-19, EXPIRES: 8-20-19; ss by #12852, eff 8-20-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p2300.html"
